      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794033540091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "若从未形成持久 COMMIT，\n完整恢复日志可支持中止；\n日志损坏不等于“从未提交”。",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "若从未形成持久 COMMIT，\n完整恢复日志可支持中止；\n日志损坏不等于“从未提交”。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
